  "body": "Positioned on the ridge line between Mission Bay and St Heliers, this impressive freestanding four-bedroom home offers a rare combination of space, privacy and high-end design.\r\n\r\nArranged over three levels and surrounded by a beautiful bush outlook, the home features generous open-plan living, a bespoke kitchen, statement media wall and 4 bedrooms, 4 beautifully appointed bathrooms plus a powder room. There is also space provided for a future lift, adding further flexibility and accessibility.\r\n\r\nQuality is evident throughout, with top-quality finishes, premium chattels, HVAC, underfloor heating and integrated background sound all included. The internal-access single garage adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nSet above SEA-protected land, the location is wonderfully peaceful yet close to Kohimarama Beach, local cafés and the waterfront, with the city approximately 15 minutes away.\r\n\r\nBrand new, beautifully finished and designed for effortless modern living — this is architectural living with nature right outside your door. Ask the neighbours - they’ll tell you exactly why this is such a fantastic place to live.",
